>>
Rule 1 (features must have a supported numeric dtype; excludes bool and complex)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 2 (non-negative shape dimensions when rank is known)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (name should not be the literal "none")
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 ≠ "none"
